## Context
Transcript survey (2026-10-11, 64 roar sessions across repos): roar typically
runs at ~200k context, ~20 of 59 above 256k, and ~22 sessions continue new
work after roar on the old context (up to 864k). Only reflect, merge review and
capture need session history; capture sat after the sweep (old step 6).

## Exit criteria
- [x] Capture moves to step 3, right after review of merges; sweep/report/docs become 4–6; steps 7–11 keep their numbers
- [x] Cross-references updated (skill, attribution design doc, test comment); journals left append-only
- [x] Step 11 ends with a context verdict: safe to /clear when nothing is pending, never /compact
